{"guid": "N61_001", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "performance_technique", "concept_label": "shot (sports)", "concept_definition": "An attempt to score points or a goal in a sport, usually by sending a ball, puck, or other object toward a scoring area.", "translations": {"en": "shot", "lt": "smūgis", "zh": "射门", "fr": "tir", "es": "tiro", "es-419": "tiro"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N61_002", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "performance_technique", "concept_label": "assist (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports, an assist is a pass or play that directly helps a teammate score.", "translations": {"en": "assist", "lt": "rezultatyvus perdavimas", "zh": "助攻", "fr": "passe décisive", "es": "asistencia", "es-419": "asistencia"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N61_003", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "performance_technique", "concept_label": "tackle (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports, a tackle is an attempt to take the ball from an opponent or bring the player carrying it to the ground.", "translations": {"en": "tackle", "lt": "taktas", "zh": "抢断", "fr": "tacle", "es": "entrada", "es-419": "entrada"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N61_004", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "performance_technique", "concept_label": "volley (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports, a volley is a hit made by striking the ball before it touches the ground.", "translations": {"en": "volley", "lt": "smūgis iš oro", "zh": "凌空击球", "fr": "volée", "es": "volea", "es-419": "volea"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N61_005", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "performance_technique", "concept_label": "ace (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports such as tennis and volleyball, an ace is a serve that the opponent cannot touch or return, scoring a point directly.", "translations": {"en": "ace", "lt": "neasugrąžinamas padavimas", "zh": "发球直接得分", "fr": "ace", "es": "ace", "es-419": "ace"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N61_006", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "performance_technique", "concept_label": "forehand (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports such as tennis, a forehand is a stroke made with the palm of the playing hand facing forward toward the direction of the swing.", "translations": {"en": "forehand", "lt": "smūgis iš dešinės", "zh": "正手击球", "fr": "coup droit", "es": "golpe de derecha", "es-419": "golpe de derecha"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N61_007", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "performance_technique", "concept_label": "backhand (sports)", "concept_definition": "A stroke in a sport, such as tennis, made with the back of the hand facing forward toward the direction of the shot.", "translations": {"en": "backhand", "lt": "smūgis iš nepatogiosios pusės", "zh": "反手击球", "fr": "revers", "es": "revés", "es-419": "revés"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N61_008", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "performance_technique", "concept_label": "smash (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports, a smash is a hard overhead shot hit forcefully downward toward the opponent or target.", "translations": {"en": "smash", "lt": "smūgis iš viršaus", "zh": "扣杀", "fr": "smash", "es": "remate", "es-419": "remate"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N61_009", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "performance_technique", "concept_label": "topspin (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports, topspin is a forward rotation given to a ball as it moves, causing it to dip or bounce differently.", "translations": {"en": "topspin", "lt": "viršutinis sukimasis", "zh": "上旋", "fr": "effet lifté", "es": "efecto liftado", "es-419": "efecto liftado"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
